Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:38:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/49] R10 (1/2): gofmt for the league's files under internal

gofmt -w on the 24 files under internal/ that the league added or changed
and that gofmt -l listed (6 non-test, 18 test files). Whitespace, line
breaks between statements and the order of two imports in one test file;
no token changes otherwise.

Not touched: internal/backend/s3/s3_test.go (identical to stock, where
gofmt -l lists it too) and two files under cmd/restic, which another repair
owns: check_structure_overlap.go and backup_progress_publication_test.go.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
